00:00:37.690 --> 00:00:42.586
Post crisis, the Dodd–Frank Act does
impose Additional requirements.

00:00:42.586 --> 00:00:44.654
Higher capital requirements for

00:00:44.654 --> 00:00:49.270
banks when they have these
securities on their balance sheets.

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:54.116
Enormous fines to the banks for
any miss-selling of mortgage products.

00:00:54.116 --> 00:00:59.399
Skin in the game requirements that
require the originators to keep

00:00:59.399 --> 00:01:04.305
a slice of these secularization
on their own balance sheets so

00:01:04.305 --> 00:01:08.382
that they have to eat
whatever they feed to others.

00:01:08.382 --> 00:01:13.826
And these requirements were

00:01:13.826 --> 00:01:21.093
enough to make the market a lot safer.

00:01:21.093 --> 00:01:25.540
It's not only that they have a lot more
