00:01:25.540 --> 00:01:29.799
So in the derivatives markets for example,

00:01:29.799 --> 00:01:35.211
most of the off exchange
derivatives are now reported,

00:01:35.211 --> 00:01:38.334
where regulators can see them.

00:01:38.334 --> 00:01:42.204
And the standard derivatives
